I am not as good an artist as Burgh,
but I have a liking for paintings.{VAR BE01}
Let me see. Today, I'd like to paint
{VAR 0103 0000}-type Pokémon!{VAR BE01}
Will you show me what kinds of Pokémon
you have?

As long as the artist enjoys creating
an artwork, it doesn't matter if the{VAR BE00}
result is judged as bad or good.

If you catch a Pokémon that's
{VAR 0103 0000} type, please show it to me!{VAR BE00}
I'll give you a little something.

Oh!
The shape of this Egg...{VAR BE01}
Superb! It gives me chills!
It's electrifying! It makes me tremble!{VAR BE01}
Alas, even I cannot tell what type
an Egg is!
